{"3655290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rotten Survivor", "steam_appid": 3655290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/4d06b291cc27dee6ad94eb721d4ed19b.poster.avif?t=1786473305\" width=1140 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/4d06b291cc27dee6ad94eb721d4ed19b.webm?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/4d06b291cc27dee6ad94eb721d4ed19b.mp4?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>RUN. THINK. SHOOT. SURVIVE!!!!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Rotten Survivor, the tools that let you create your own play style are AT YOUR FINGERTIPS, stack effects and modifiers, upgrade your weapons, and prove you got the GRIT to survive until rescue arrives. But don't get confused, it's not as easy as you think... You are fighting a TIRELESS crowd, that will do anything to defeat you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/a3515612f68358a8b48bca0468f1308d.poster.avif?t=1786473305\" width=1140 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/a3515612f68358a8b48bca0468f1308d.webm?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/a3515612f68358a8b48bca0468f1308d.mp4?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><u> </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>UNLIMITED POWER!!!!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 60 modifiers (upgrades), and a variety of different weapons to choose from, to make each run unique and challenging. The more runs you do, the more weapon and modifiers you can unlock. The more modifiers you collect, the more their effects scale, the more they synergise into EVEN CRAZIER effects! There is really NO LIMIT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/89c148f6eee03ac9875bc4dface18037.poster.avif?t=1786473305\" width=1140 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/89c148f6eee03ac9875bc4dface18037.webm?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/89c148f6eee03ac9875bc4dface18037.mp4?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>DUAL WIELDING MADNESS!!!!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Savour the FREEDOM to equip any set of weapons:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <i>SMG</i> X A <i>Katana</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pair of <i>Boxing Gloves</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <i>Chainsaw</i> X A <i>Rifle.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>TWO MINIGUNS???</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions to what crazy combination of weapons you can use, you have two hands and a MISSION, and how you deal with it is COMPLETELY UP TO YOU.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/545a15124c7cbc44464283500a6c40bb.poster.avif?t=1786473305\" width=1140 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/545a15124c7cbc44464283500a6c40bb.webm?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/545a15124c7cbc44464283500a6c40bb.mp4?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ESCAPE OR KEEP FIGHTING!!!!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of your mission, there is going to be a rescue team to make contact. You can fly away and finish what you started, OR stay and see how much you can handle. BUT BE WARNED, it's going to be like HELL...</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/4d06b291cc27dee6ad94eb721d4ed19b.poster.avif?t=1786473305\" width=1140 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/4d06b291cc27dee6ad94eb721d4ed19b.webm?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/4d06b291cc27dee6ad94eb721d4ed19b.mp4?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>RUN. THINK. SHOOT. SURVIVE!!!!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Rotten Survivor, the tools that let you create your own play style are AT YOUR FINGERTIPS, stack effects and modifiers, upgrade your weapons, and prove you got the GRIT to survive until rescue arrives. But don't get confused, it's not as easy as you think... You are fighting a TIRELESS crowd, that will do anything to defeat you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/a3515612f68358a8b48bca0468f1308d.poster.avif?t=1786473305\" width=1140 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/a3515612f68358a8b48bca0468f1308d.webm?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/a3515612f68358a8b48bca0468f1308d.mp4?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><u> </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>UNLIMITED POWER!!!!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 60 modifiers (upgrades), and a variety of different weapons to choose from, to make each run unique and challenging. The more runs you do, the more weapon and modifiers you can unlock. The more modifiers you collect, the more their effects scale, the more they synergise into EVEN CRAZIER effects! There is really NO LIMIT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/89c148f6eee03ac9875bc4dface18037.poster.avif?t=1786473305\" width=1140 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/89c148f6eee03ac9875bc4dface18037.webm?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/89c148f6eee03ac9875bc4dface18037.mp4?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>DUAL WIELDING MADNESS!!!!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Savour the FREEDOM to equip any set of weapons:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <i>SMG</i> X A <i>Katana</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pair of <i>Boxing Gloves</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <i>Chainsaw</i> X A <i>Rifle.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>TWO MINIGUNS???</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions to what crazy combination of weapons you can use, you have two hands and a MISSION, and how you deal with it is COMPLETELY UP TO YOU.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/545a15124c7cbc44464283500a6c40bb.poster.avif?t=1786473305\" width=1140 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/545a15124c7cbc44464283500a6c40bb.webm?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/extras/545a15124c7cbc44464283500a6c40bb.mp4?t=1786473305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ESCAPE OR KEEP FIGHTING!!!!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of your mission, there is going to be a rescue team to make contact. You can fly away and finish what you started, OR stay and see how much you can handle. BUT BE WARNED, it's going to be like HELL...</p>", "short_description": "Fight massive hordes of bizarre zombies! Start with an axe and upgrade to a bazooka, equip a rifle and a katana, or a machine gun and a grenade launcher. Create your own play style and become an unstoppable force! But the question is... Are YOU stuck with THEM, or are THEY stuck with YOU?", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/9053ce59acaf8be01dc6f6ae03cd9c39ee25c535/header.jpg?t=1786473305", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/e87abc2454101624f58a29bde24f20c9fcd6877a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786473305", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/e87abc2454101624f58a29bde24f20c9fcd6877a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786473305", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 2100 or AMD E1-2100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256mb VRAM/DirectX 11 Support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 9400f or AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1gb VRAM/DirectX 11 Support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Inventario"], "publishers": ["Inventario"], "demos": [{"appid": 3672310, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 59, "description": "Steam Input API Support"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655290/ad2e9dfe902b3239c4b77857fc1882fd6028ac18/ss_ad2e9dfe902b3239c4b77857